cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ewf-geom-opt: EWF-Based Geometry Optimization with SQD Solver"
abstract: "Geometry optimization driven by Embedded Wave Function (EWF) analytic
  nuclear gradients, built on quantum embedding with FCI / Selected-CI / SCI-SBD /
  SQD (Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization) cluster solvers, PySCF integrals, and
  a choice of geometry optimizer (geomeTRIC, PyBerny, or Sella)."
repository-code: "https://github.com/MIQuLab/ewf-geom-opt"
license: MIT
